<title>UK: TABLE-SmithKline Q2 profits rise, sales dip.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SmithKline Q2 profits rise, sales dip.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second quarter to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		8.4	 vs	8.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.41	vs	4.0</p>
<p> Pretax *		   356	 vs	342</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,895     vs	1,924</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 360 and 382 million stg. Pre-tax profits excluding the effect of currency was up 16 percent at 398 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - SmithKline Beecham Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
